sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Dev as Developer
    participant Broker as Access broker<br/>(Teleport / PIM / Identity Center)
    actor Mgr as Approver
    participant Prod as Production DB
    Dev->>Broker: Request access + ticket + reason
    Broker->>Mgr: Approval request (Slack)
    Mgr-->>Broker: Approve for 60 min
    Broker-->>Dev: Short-lived credential
    Dev->>Prod: Connect (session logged)
    Note over Broker,Prod: Timer expires
    Broker->>Prod: Revoke credential automatically
